\r\nprimitives, SQL que\u001b[Cies, and the\u001b[Cfunctional strings above. Abs\u001b[Cnce of a big wallet-name list does\u001b[1m not\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m falsify\u001b[2Ctealc.\u001b[39m                        \r\n                                                                                    \r\n\u001b[93m\u001b[1mFalsifiable checks:\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m GDI/GDI+ screenshot APIs (GetDC/BitBlt/GdipSaveImageToStream or sim\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93milar) + EnumDisplayMonitors (multi-monitor);\r\nCreateProcess/ShellExecute paired\u001b[Cwith\u001b[Cmsiex\u001b[Cc/powershell l\u001b[Cterals; SQL SELECT literals; cmd + timeout + del l\u001b[Cterals.\u001b[39m                            \r\n                                                                                                                     \r\n\u001b[97m🤖\u001b[36m\u001b[1m ReverseEngineer(Callisto)\r\n\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[97mCRT noise so far. Let me grep the blob region for the telling strings and read the embedded import table area, plus decompile the API resolver\r\nFUN_14003c2ac.\u001b[39m                                                                                                        "]
