[0.002, "o", "\u001b[4;1H\u001b[93m\u001b[1m(4/8) Checklist — capability set\r\n\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[C                                                 \r\n\u001b[93m[external knowledge] Advertised/observed Stealc capabilities (v1 and v2):\u001b[8;1H-\u001b[1m Browsers:\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m Chromium\u001b[Cfamily (Chr\u001b[Cme, Edge, Brave, Opera, Vivaldi, …)\u001b[C— passwords, cookies, autofill, CC; Gecko family (Firefox, Thunderbird) —\r\nkey4.db/logins.json. v2 additionally handles\u001b[1m Chrome App-Bound Encryption (ABE)\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m cookies (see comment 5).\u001b[10;3H\u001b[1mExtensions/wallets:\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m 100+ browser-extension targets, dominate\u001b[C by crypto wallets\u001b[C(MetaMask, TronLink, Phantom, Ronin, etc.) + 2FA extensions;\r\nd\u001b[Csktop wallets (Electrum, Exodus, Atomic, Coinomi, Guarda, Daedalus, Ledger Live…).\u001b[39m                   \u001b[12;2H\u001b[93m \u001b[1mOth\u001b[Cr app\u001b[C:\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m Telegram, Discord, Tox, Pidgi\u001b[C; email (Outlook, Thunde\u001b[Cbird); VPN clien\u001b[Cs (ProtonVPN, OpenVPN); Steam.\u001b[39m                   "]
