[0.000, "o", "                                                                                                                                     \r\n\u001b[93m\u001b[1mCaveat:\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m because target lists come from the \u001b[Cerver, the static\u001b[Cstring se\u001b[C may co\u001b[Ctain surprisingly few application names — mostly path/registry/API\r\nprimitives, SQL queries, and the functional strings above. Absence of a big wallet-name list does\u001b[1m not\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m falsify Stealc.\r\n\u001b[39m                                                                                                                                                  \r\n\u001b[93m\u001b[1mFalsifiable checks:\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m GDI/GDI+\u001b[Cscreenshot APIs (GetDC/BitBlt/GdipSaveImageToStream or simi\u001b[Car)\u001b[C+ EnumDisplayMonitors (multi-monitor);\r\nCreateProcess/ShellExecute paired with msiexec/powershell literals; SQL SELECT literals; cmd + timeout + del literals.\r\n\u001b[39m                                                                       "]
