:str\u001b[Cng\u001b[97m objects (classic SSO\u001b[93m 0xf < capacity\u001b[97m pattern) —\u001b(B\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[97mdynamic API resolution via decrypted names, not hashes. Let me confirm the real main and rename it.\r\n\u001b[39m \u001b[C                        \r\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[39m \u001b[90mReverseEngineer(Europa) · ▸ decomp_function(0x14002a88c) · 4756 chars\u001b[39m                                                                     \r\n                                                                                                                                                     \r\n\u001b[97m🤖\u001b[36m\u001b[1m ReverseEngineer(Callisto)\u001b(B\u001b[m                                                                       \r\n\u001b[97mThe injector's API pointers are filled by GetProcAddress over\u001b[3m decrypted\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[97m string globals (ties into #q-string-decryption). Let me find the writer of\r\none of those string globals and emulate it to confirm the API names.\u001b[39m   \u001b[42;100H\u001b[90m224\u001b[C136\u001b[9C1\u001b[C128\u001b[12C275\u001b[C264\u001b[6C3\u001b[C0\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
