[0.040, "o", "\u001b[4;1H\u001b[93m\u001b[1m(8/8) IOC hunting patterns + attribution decision rule\r\n\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[C                                                 \r\n\u001b[93m[external knowledge] Distinctive patterns to hunt in \u001b[1mdecrypted\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m strings:\u001b[8;1H- C2 URL (often bare\u001b[CIP + pa\u001b[Ch; v1 gates ended in\u001b[C/<hex>.php; v2 path convention differs — recover, don't assume) and a short\u001b[1m build/campaign tag\r\n\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m(e.g. default, actor-chosen names).\u001b[10;3HProtocol tokens: v1 hwid, build,\u001b[Cmessag\u001b[C, toke\u001b[C; v2 JSON key names (recover exact s\u001b[Ct — th\u001b[Cy are go\u001b[Cd YARA/IOC m\u001b[Cterial).\u001b[39m                     \r\n\u001b[93m- Hardcoded \u001b[1mUser-Agent\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m literal.\u001b[39m    \u001b[12;3H\u001b[93mSys\u001b[Cem-inf\u001b[C report scaffolding (Vidar-style labels like OS:,\u001b[CDisplay/resolution, HWID:,\u001b[Cinstall-date,\u001b[Clocale fields).\u001b[39m    \u001b[13;3H\u001b[93mSQL queries (SELECT or\u001b[Cgin_url, username_value, password_val\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93mue FROM logins, FROM cookies, FROM autofill, FROM credit_cards).\u001b[14;3HBrowser data paths\u001b[C(\\User Data\\, Local State, logins.json, key4.db, formhis\u001b[Cory.sqlite), MachineGuid\u001b[2Ccmd/timeout/del.\u001b[15;3HRC4\u001b[Ckey string itself (reusab\u001b[Ce\u001b[Ca\u001b[C a build-sp\u001b[Ccific IOC).\u001b[39m                                                                   \r\n                                                                                                                        \r\n\u001b[93m\u001b[1mAttribution decision rule — call it Stealc v2 CONFIRMED if most of these hold:\u001b[19;1H\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[94m1. \u001b[93mSingle hardcoded-key \u001b[1mRC4\u001b[C(±base64)\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m string decryption (comment 2) ✔/✘\u001b[39m       \r\n\u001b[94m2. \u001b[93mMinimal embedded config = \u001b[1mC2 URL + build ID\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m; target lists absent/server-side (comment 3) ✔/✘\r\n\u001b[94m3\u001b[2C\u001b[93mC2 messaging is \u001b[1mHTTP POST + JSON\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m (v2) rather than form-data (v1\u001b[2C(co\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[93mmment 3) ✔/✘\r\n\u001b[94m4\u001b[2C\u001b[93mx64 + statically-li\u001b[Cked\u001b[CSQLite + no DLL-downlo\u001b[Cd URLs (comments 1, 4) ✔/✘\u001b[39m                   \r\n\u001b[94m5\u001b[2C\u001b[93mEmbedded PE plausibly a \u001b[1mChrome ABE helper\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m (comme\u001b[Ct 5) ✔/✘\u001b[39m                       \r\n\u001b[94m6\u001b[2C\u001b[93mLight\u001b[Canti-ana\u001b[2Csis: HAL9TH/JohnDoe\u001b[Cand/or date kill switch and/or\u001b[CCIS locale check (comment 6) ✔/✘\r\n\u001b[94m7\u001b[2C\u001b[93m\u001b[1mNo persistence\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m, \u001b[Celf-delete present (comment 7) ✔/✘\u001b[39m      \r\n                                                                                                      \r\n\u001b[93mIf (3) shows form-data/.php gates ins\u001b[Cead of JSON,\u001b[Cthe sample may be v1-lineage code in an x64 build — downgrade to \"Stealc, version uncertain\". If\r\n(1) fails outright, re-examine attribution entirely despite the YARA hits.\r\n\u001b[39m                                                                                                                                                   \r\n\u001b[90m○\u001b[39m \u001b[90mReverseEngineer(Callisto) · ▸ search_forum(init_decrypted_string_table decrypted s…) · …running\u001b[32;92H\u001b[36m\u001b[1m⠴ \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[90mThink\u001b[2Cg…\u001b[39m \u001b[35m\u001b[1mRever\u001b[2CEngineer(Callisto)\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[37m: calling search_forum\u001b[34;2H\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
