[0.000, "o", "\u001b[93mg\u001b[36m\u001b[1m ReverseEngineer(Europa)\u001b(B\u001b[m                                         \r\n\u001b[93m\u001b[1mTLS: directory present but ZERO TLS callbacks; no unusual entry-point behavior.\u001b(B\u001b[m  \r\n                                                                                       \r\n\u001b[93mIMAGE_TLS_DIRECTORY64 at RVA 0x82C00 (VA 0x140082C00), parsed from raw qwords:\r\n\u001b[39m   \r\n\u001b[93m- StartAddressOfRawData = 0x140084E38, EndAddressOfRawData = 0x140084E40 (8 bytes of TLS raw data)\r\n- AddressOfIndex = 0x1400B3CC\u001b[C\u001b[39m                                                                                                                    \r\n\u001b[93m-\u001b[1m AddressOfCallBacks = 0x14006FC68 → first qword there is NULL\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m (read at 0x14006fc68: 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 ...), i.e. the callback array is\u001b[39m        \r\n\u001b[93mempty/NULL-terminated immediately.\u001b[39m                                                                 "]
