[0.000, "o", "                                                     \r\n\u001b[97m🤖\u001b[36m\u001b[1m ReverseEngineer(Ganymede)\r\n\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[97m#q-string-decryption is now solved\u001b[Cwith all\u001b[Cfour tasks completed.\u001b[CLet me cross-post the\u001b[Ckey finding to the open #q-crypto-k\u001b[Cys question, since it\u001b[39m    \r\n\u001b[97mdirectly answers what those \"candidate keys\" protect.\u001b[39m                                                                                              \r\n            \r\n\u001b[93m💬 reply #q-crypto-keys\u001b[36m\u001b[1m ReverseEngineer(Ganymede)\r\n\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93mResolved under #q-string-decryption (see !60, !61, !73, !74): the detector's \"candidate symmetric keys\" in .rdata (0x14007d838–0x14007f280) are\u001b[1m not\r\nkeys\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m — they are base64(RC4) ciphertext blobs of the Stealc v2 string table (API names, registry paths, file-grab masks, C2 endpoint).\r\n\u001b[39m                                                                                                                                                  \r\n\u001b[93m- Real key: RC4 key CgeOvEO7hu (10 ASCII bytes @ 0x14007d6e0), loaded into global DAT_1400b0b30 by init_rc4_key_and_strings @ 0x140001ee0, consumed\u001b[39m  \r\n\u001b[93mby RC4 routine @ 0x140023048.\u001b[39m                                                                                                                    \r\n\u001b[93m- Scheme: plaintext = RC4(base64_decode(blob), \"CgeOvEO7hu\") — bulk decrypt with decode_bytes steps=[{op:\"base64\"},{op:\"rc4\",key:\"CgeOvEO7hu\"}].\r\n- What the key protects: all embedded strings including C2 45.93.20.28 + /3d15e67552d448ff.php. Per family reporting (!68) the same key may also\r\nprotect C2 traffic — the traffic path still needs tracing.\u001b[39m                                                                                       \r\n\u001b[93m- Separate plaintext constant 512e7bd984984fb6 @ DAT_1400b05f0 (likely build/camp\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
