[0.080, "o", "\u001b[4;1H                                                     \r\n\u001b[36m\u001b[1m## Summary of findings\r\n\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[C                                               \r\n\u001b[97m\u001b[1mDecryption scheme (Stealc v2 string obfuscation confirmed):\u001b(B\u001b[m                                                                                        \r\n                                                                                                                                     \r\n\u001b[97m- \u001b[93mplaintext = RC4(base64_decode(blob), key)\r\n\u001b[97m- \u001b[1mDecrypt helper:\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[97m \u001b[93mFUN_14000\u001b[Cd04\u001b[97m @ 0x140007d04 (\u001b[93mdecrypt_string_b64_rc4\u001b[97m), composed of:\u001b[39m                                                               \r\n\u001b[97m    - \u001b[93mFUN_1400234bc\u001b[97m @ 0x1400234bc — standard-alphabet base64 decoder\r\n    - \u001b[93mFUN_140023048\u001b[97m @ 0x140023048 — textbook RC4 (256-byte KSA + PRGA XOR), keyed from global \u001b[93mDAT_1400b0b30\u001b[39m                                     \r\n\u001b[97m-\u001b[1m String-table initializers (C++ dynamic initializers, run pre-main):\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m FUN_140002b6c\u001b[97m @ 0x140002b6c (~200 blobs) and\u001b[93m FUN_140001\u001b[Ce0\u001b[97m @ 0x140001ee0 (sets\r\nthe key, then more blobs). Each decrypted string is stored into a global std::string slot in .data.\r\n\u001b[39m                                                                                                     \r\n\u001b[97m\u001b[1mKey (triple-verified: code path, raw bytes, functional decrypt):\r\n\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[C                          \r\n\u001b[97m- RC4 key = \u001b[93mCgeOvEO7hu\u001b[97m (10 ASC\u001b[CI bytes,\u001b[C\u001b[93m43 67 65 4f 76 45 4f 37 68 75\u001b[C\u001b[97m@ \u001b[1m0x14007d6e0\u001b[C\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[97min .rdata)\u001b[39m                      \r\n\u001b[97m- Secondary plain