[0.034, "o", "\u001b[4;1H\u001b[93mPK11_GetInternalKeySlot\u001b[97m; dozens of runtime-resolved API names (WinHttp*, Gdip*, Reg*) including the family-fingerprint typo\u001b[93m GetCerrentProcessId\u001b[5;3H\u001b[97mThe detector's 18 \"candidate symmetric keys\" were disproved — they're mid-string carvings of ciphertext blobs, not keys.\r\n\u001b[39m                                                                                                                                        \r\n\u001b[97m\u001b[1mBulk-decrypt recipe for the developer:\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m decode_bytes steps=[{op:\"base64\"},{op:\"rc4\",key:\"CgeOvEO7hu\"}]\u001b[97m applied to every\u001b[Cbase64 literal referenced from\r\n0x140002b6\u001b[C and 0x140001ee0. All funct\u001b[Cons renam\u001b[Cd in Ghidra and the k\u001b[Cy site an\u001b[Cotated for\u001b[Cpers\u001b[Cst\u001b[Cnc\u001b[C.\u001b[39m                  \u001b[10;1H\u001b[97m🤖\u001b[36m\u001b[1m ReverseEngineer(Callisto)\u001b(B\u001b[m                                                         "]
[0.000, "o", "                                                                \r\n\u001b[97mThe seven injector-string init sites s\u001b[Ct in o\u001b[Ce run (0x140005328…0x14000549c,\u001b[C0x3e \u001b[Cpart). Let me r\u001b[Cad those code windows to extract the base64\r\nliteral addresses.\r\n\u001b[39m \u001b[C                          \r\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[39m \u001b[90mReverseEngineer(Callisto) · ▸ read(1400052e0) · 960 chars\u001b[39m                                                                                    \r\n                  \r\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[C\u001b[90mReverseEngineer(Callisto) · ▸ read(140004ca0) · 544 chars\r\n\u001b[39m \u001b[C                                                         \r\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[C\u001b[90mReverseEngineer(Callisto) · ▸ read(140003c40) · 224 chars\r\n\u001b[39m \u001b[C                                                         \r\n\u001b[97m🤖\u001b[36m\u001b[1m ReverseEngineer(Callisto)\r\n\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[97mRe\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.001, "o", "\u001b[97msolved the base64 blob addresses for all injector/pipe globals by decoding the init blocks. Now read the ciphertexts.\u001b[23;1H\u001b[32m●\u001b[C\u001b[90mReverseEngineer(Callisto) · ▸ read(14007e238) · 416 chars\r\n\u001b[39m                                                                                                                       \r\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[C\u001b[90mReverseEngineer(Callisto) · ▸ read(14007df38) · 224 chars\r\n\u001b[39m \u001b[C                                                         \r\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[C\u001b[90mReverseEngineer(Callisto) · ▸ read(14007dab0) · 160 chars\r\n\u001b[39m \u001b[C                                                         \r\n\u001b[97m🤖\u001b[36m\u001b[1m ReverseEngineer(Callisto)\r\n\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[97mDecrypting all recovered blobs (base64 → RC4 \"CgeOvEO7hu\"):\u001b[42;99H\u001b[90m846\u001b[C2\u001b[C1\u001b[8C90\u001b[C036\u001b[12C936\u001b[C317\u001b[5C3\u001b[C0\u001b[C99\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[34;2H"]
[0.013, "o", "\u001b[4;1H                                                                                                                                               \r\n\u001b[97m\u001b[1mBulk-decrypt recipe for the developer:\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m decode_bytes steps=[{op:\"base64\"},{op:\"rc4\",key:\"CgeOvEO7hu\"}]\u001b[97m applied to\u001b[Cevery base64 literal referenced from\r\n0x140002b6c and 0x140001ee0. All functions renamed in Ghidra and the key site annotated for persistence.\r\n\u001b[39m                                                                                                                                                     \r\n\u001b[97m🤖\u001b[36m\u001b[1m ReverseEngineer(Callisto)\u001b(B\u001b[m                                                                            \r\n\u001b[97mThe seven injector-string init sites sit in one run (0x140005328…0x14000549c, 0x3e apart). Let me read those code windows to extract the base64\r\nliteral addresses.\u001b[39m          \r\n                  "]
