[0.027, "o", "\u001b[4;1H                                                                                                                                         \r\n\u001b[93mSource: full bulk decrypt of the RC4/base64 \u001b[Ctring table\u001b[C(276 plaintexts, posted in full as !82/!83 under #q-bulk-strings; script\r\nstealc_fulltable_sweep, pipeline base64 → RC4(\"CgeOvEO7hu\") ov\u001b[Cr the enti\u001b[Ce .rd\u001b[Cta\u001b[Csection, eve\u001b[Cy undecoded token individually\u001b[Cacc\u001b[Cunted for as\u001b[39m    \r\n\u001b[93mplaintext).\u001b[39m                                                                                                                                   \r\n                                                                                           \r\n\u001b[93mCase-insensitive sweep of all 276\u001b[Cdecryp\u001b[Ced plaintexts:\u001b[39m                                                                                              \r\n                                                     "]
