[0.006, "o", "\u001b[4;9H\u001b[93mf0\u001b[3CCopyF\u001b[CleA\u001b[39m           \u001b[5;9H\u001b[93mf1\u001b[3CDeleteFileA\u001b[39m                                        \u001b[6;9H\u001b[93mf2\u001b[3CWriteFile\u001b[7;9Hf3\u001b[3CCr\u001b[CateFileW\u001b[39m    \u001b[8;9H\u001b[93mf5\u001b[3CReadFile\u001b[39m        \u001b[9;9H\u001b[93mf6\u001b[3CGetFileSizeEx\u001b[39m \u001b[10;9H\u001b[93mf7\u001b[3CCreat\u001b[CNamedPipeA            (ABE helper key return pipe)\u001b[11;9Hf98\u001b[2ClstrlenA\u001b[39m \u001b[12;9H\u001b[93mfa8\u001b[2CGe\u001b[CEnvironmentVariableA\r\n```\u001b[39m                   \r\n                        \r\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[39m \u001b[90mDeveloper(Metis) · ▸ flag_for_review(Developer(Metis)) · 769 chars\r\n\u001b[39m                        \r\n\u001b[97m🤖\u001b[36m\u001b[1m Developer(Metis)\u001b(B\u001b[m  \r\n\u001b[97m⚑ flagged for analyst review: Ransomware refutation rests on string/API evidence, not a full code trace\r\n\u001b[39m                                                                     \r\n\u001b[97m🤖\u001b[36m\u001b[1m Developer(Callirrhoe)\r\n\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[97mPosted. Now a brief pointer under #q-bulk-strings, which asks for exactly this list:\r\n\u001b[39m   \r\n\u001b[93m💬 reply #q-bulk-strings\u001b[36m\u001b[1m Developer(Callirrhoe)\r\n\u001b[93m#strtable-global-map (+ its part-2 comment !91) publishes the full decrypted table for\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m init_decrypted_string_table\u001b[1m @ 0x140002b6c: all 260 blobs, as\r\n\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93mglobal .data addr | blob .rdata addr | plaintext\u001b[1m, 0 decode errors.\r\n\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[C                 \r\n\u001b[93mCoverage note: this covers every blob processed by 0x140002b6c (the big initializer). Blobs handled only by init_rc4_key_and_strings @ 0x140001ee0 (a\r\nhandful, incl. the key itself and build ID 512e7bd984984fb6) and any decrypt-on-demand literals in other functions (e.g. the injector-API names in\r\n!78) are\u001b[3m not\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m in this table — the earlier .rdata-wide sweep scripts (bulk_decrypt_b64_rc4)\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m cover those by address without destination mapping. Script\r\nmap_strtable_globals reruns the whole extraction from the decompile + .rdata byte index.\u001b[32;94H\u001b[36m\u001b[1m⠸ \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[90mThinking…\u001b[39m \u001b[35m\u001b[1mDevelop\u001b[Cr(Callirrhoe)\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[37m: ca\u001b[Cling create_comment\u001b[34;2H\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
