[0.021, "o", "\u001b[4;1H                                                                                                                                                   \r\n\u001b[97m🤖\u001b[36m\u001b[1m ReverseEngineer(Lysithea)\u001b(B\u001b[m                                        \r\n\u001b[97mThe question #q-persistence is fully answered and already marked\u001b[1m solved\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[97m (I confirmed its status via follow_link; the developer's answer !107 plus my\r\nindependent corroboration !121 now sit under it).\r\n\u001b[39m                                                                                                                                                    \r\n\u001b[36m\u001b[1m## Summary of the verdict\u001b(B\u001b[m                        \u001b[11;1H\u001b[97m\u001b[1mPersistence: ABSENT from this sample's own code\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[97m — concluded from four independent, coverage-stated evidence streams:\u001b[13;1H\u001b[94m1.\u001b[97m\u001b[1m Plaintext\u001b[Cbyte sweep (my run):\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m grep_bytes\u001b[97m over\u001b[Cthe entire 745,472-byte file (0x0–0xb6000, ASCII\u001b[C+ UTF-16LE, c\u001b[Cse-insensitive, including the\r\nembedded ABE-helper DLL at 0x890d0) for 18 persistence tokens (\u001b[93mCurrentVersion\\Run\u001b[97m,\u001b[93m RunOnce\u001b[97m,\u001b[93m schtasks\u001b[97m,\u001b[93m CreateService\u001b[97m,\u001b[93m OpenSCManager\u001b[97m,\u001b[93m winlogon\u001b[97m,\u001b[93m Image\r\nFile Execution\u001b[97m,\u001b[93m ITaskService\u001b[97m, WMI\u001b[C\u001b[93mRoot\\subscription\u001b[97m/\u001b[93mEventConsumer\u001b[97m/\u001b[93mEventFilter\u001b[97m,\u001b[Cetc.) → only benign\u001b[Cmatches: the CRT \u001b[Cmport nam\u001b[C\u001b[93m GetStartupInfoW\r\n\u001b[97m(twice, in the host's and helper DLL's import tabl\u001b[Cs).\u001b[39m                                                                                             \r\n\u001b[94m2.\u001b[97m\u001b[1m Full decrypted string table (277 plainte\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[97m\u001b[1mxts, every base64(RC4) blob in .rdata, posted in full under #q-bulk-strings):\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[97m keyword sweep yields only 4\r\nnon-p\u001b[Crs\u001b[Cstence hi\u001b[Cs (\u001b[93mGdiplusStartup\u001b[97m,\u001b[93m run_as_admin\u001b[97m,\u001b[93m runas\u001b[97m,\u001b[93m \\t- Running Path:\u001b[97m ). I independently re-decrypted the\u001b[93m run_as_admin\u001b[97m blob at 0x14007ece8\r\nbyte-by-byte to validate the pipeline.\u001b[39m                                                                                                              \r\n\u001b[94m3.\u001b[97m\u001b[1m API capability map:\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[97m static imports = CRT +\u001b[93m WININET!InternetSetOptionA\u001b[97m only (no\u001b[Cadva\u001b[Ci32); the 122 runtime-resolved API names include a stri\u001b[Ctly\r\n\u001b[1mread-only\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[97m r\u001b[Cgistry set (RegOpenK\u001b[CyEx/RegQueryValueEx/RegEnumKeyEx/RegCloseKey) — no\u001b[93m RegSetValueEx\u001b[97m/\u001b[93mRegCreateKey\u001b[97m, no service APIs, no Task Scheduler\r\nAPIs.\u001b[39m                                                                                                                                             \r\n\u001b[94m4. \u001b[97m\u001b[1mTask Scheduler COM CLSID\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[97m \u001b[93m{0F87369F-A4E5-4CFC-BD3E-73E6154572DD}\u001b[97m little-endian\u001b[Cbytes: 0 matches in program memory (verified by\u001b[Cme\u001b[Cindepend\u001b[Cnt\u001b[Cy).\r\n\u001b[39m     \r\n\u001b[97mThe\u001b[93m CurrentVersion\\Uninstall\u001b[97m string is confirmed as installed-app enumeration via read-only Reg APIs, as the\u001b[Cquestion anticipated. Calibratio\u001b[C: the\r\nC2-driven loader (EXE/MSI/PowerShell download-and-execute) could deliver a second stage that persists — that is a server-side capability, not a\r\nmechanism in this binary. The positive\u001b[3Cunterpart matches the Stealc sm\u001b[Csh-and-grab pr\u