9TH/JohnDoe check\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[97m (ciphert\u001b[Cx\u001b[C-pr\u001b[Cfix searches 0 m\u001b[Ctch\u001b[Cs; GetComputerNameW/GetUserNameW\u001b[Cconsumed only by the event-name/report builders),\u001b[1m no\r\nanti-VM\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[97m (VMware\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[97m/VBox/VirtualBox/Sbie/QEMU enc\u001b[2Cpted-prefix +\u001b[Cplaintext\u001b[Csweeps all negative), and\u001b[1m no anti-debug beyond CRT\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[97m: FUN_14003fcbc is \u001b[Che stock\r\nCRT\u001b[93m __raise_securityfailure\u001b[97m/fastfail r\u001b[Cporter (detector flag refuted under #fn-140\u001b[C3fcbc), and both other IsDebuggerPresent sit\u001b[Cs are FID-matched\r\n\u001b[93m__acrt_*\u001b[97m library code. (!117, !119)\u001b[39m                                                                                         \r\n                                                                                                                                                    \r\n\u001b[97mRenames/comments persisted in the Ghidra project; a review\u001b[Cflag records th\u001b[C \"%p-of-suka\" interpretation and the residual mid-blob caveat\u001b[Cpending\u001b[39m     \r\n\u001b[97m#q-bulk-strings.\u001b[39m                                                                                                                                 \r\n                                   \r\n\u001b[97m🤖\u001b[36m\u001b[1m ReverseEngineer(Pasiphae)\r\n\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[97mGood:\u001b[93m FUN_14001b6ac\u001b[97m = Chrom\u001b[Cum data-file\u001b[Ccoll\u001b[3Cor (Cookies/Lo\u001b[Cin Data),\u001b[93m FUN_14001fa90\u001b[97m =\u001b[CFir\u001b[Cfox NSS decryptor,\u001b[93m FUN_140025b64\u001b[97m = config parser\u001b[39m   \r\n\u001b[97m(stea\u001b[C_ou\u001b[Clook)\u001b[C Batch 2: profiling/loader/self-delete globals.\u001b[42;98H\u001b[90m665\u001b[C486\u001b[10C1\u001b[C392\u001b[13C106\u001b[C878\u001b[8C49\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[34;2H"]
