[0.017, "o", "\u001b[4;1H\u001b[93mbase64 tokens byte-for-byte at 0x14007deb0/0x14007dec8 — two\u001b[Croutes, same answer.\u001b[39m                                                         \r\n                                                                                                                                                     \r\n\u001b[93m\u001b[1mGrabber executor\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m FUN_1400082d8\u001b[1m → renamed\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m grabber_enum_match_collect_files\u001b[C(recu\u001b[Csive; literals \"%s\\\\*\", \".\", \"..\", \"%s\\\\%s\", \",\", \"%s%s\" @\r\n0x14007f4c0–0x14007f4e0):\r\n\u001b[39m                                                                                                                                          \r\n\u001b[94m1. \u001b[93mwsprintfA(buf, \"%s\\\\*\", dir) → FindFirstFileA / FindNextFileA / FindClose loop; skips ./.. via StrCmpCA.\r\n\u001b[94m2. \u001b[93mTokenizes the rule's mask list on \",\" and tests each filename with PathMatchSpecA.\r\n\u001b[94m3\u001b[C\u001b[93m On match: CopyFileA(fullpath, <staging prefix\u001b[CDAT_1400b1170>+random, failIfExist\u001b[C=1) — stages a copy; optional size cap via CreateFileW(name,\r\nGENERIC_READ, sha\u001b[Ce=3) + GetFileSizeEx (sum in KB vs rule's m\u001b[Cx_size).\u001b[39m               \r\n\u001b[94m4\u001b[2C\u001b[93mread_whole_file_to_buffer (FUN_14001a834): GetFileSizeEx → Loc\u001b[ClAlloc(LMEM_ZEROINIT\u001b[2C→\u001b[1m ReadFile\u001b[C\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m→ CloseHandle.\u001b[1m The only data operation performed\r\non a victim file is a read.\u001b(B\u001b[m                                           \r\n\u001b[94m5\u001b[2C\u001b[93mFUN_140009814 appends (report-relative-path, buff\u001b[Cr, size)\u001b[Cinto the\u001b[1m in-memory collection vector at ctx+0x20\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m — the exfil payload (matches the C2\u001b[39m \r\n\u001b[93mschema upload_file/filename/data and server-driven rule schema csidl/start_path/masks/recursive/max_size in !85/!86).\r\n\u001b[94m6\u001b[C \u001b[93mDeleteFileA on its \u001b[1mown staging copy\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m only; recurses in\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93mto subdirec\u001b[Cories (attr & 0x10) with a depth cap.\u001b[39m                                         \r\n                                                                                                                     \r\n\u001b[93m\u001b[1mCall chain:\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m wWinMa\u001b[Cn → stealer_main_payload (FUN_140029f68) → run_grabb\u001b[Cr_rules\u001b[C(FUN_140008b30) → grabber_enum_match_collect_files; the one hardcoded\r\nrule is built by build_steam_grabber_rule\u001b[1m (FUN_140037704)\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m: reads the Steam install path from HKCU (RegOpenKeyExA/RegQueryValueExA via\r\nDAT_1400b4e50/4e48),\u001b[Cattaches mask list ssfn*,config.vd\u001b[C,DialogConfig.vdf,… (global 0x14\u001b[2Cb1a50\u001b[C←\u001b[Cblo\u001b[C 0x14007f230) and \u001b[Cabel\u001b[1m \"Steam\"\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m (global\u001b[39m        \r\n\u001b[93m0x1400b21d0 ←\u001b[2Clo\u001b[C 0x14007f2b0 mF/tbWQ=, decode re-verified). All other rules come\u001b[Cfrom\u001b[Cthe C2 config — Steam cred\u001b[Cntial theft + server-configured\r\ngr\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93mab, exfiltrat\u001b[Cd in\u001b[Cmemory.\u001b[1m Nothing in this path writes, renames, or encrypts a user file.\u001b(B\u001b[m                                                  \r\n                                                                                                                                                  \r\n\u001b[97m🤖\u001b[36m\u001b[1m ReverseEngineer(Pasiphae)\u001b(B\u001b[m                                                               \r\n\u001b[93mFUN_140029900\u001b[97m is already renamed\u001b[93m c2_loader_tasking\u001b[97m: POSTs a \"loader\" request to C2 and dispatches tasks: type 0 →\u001b[93m FUN_140028978\u001b[97m (EXE), 1 →\r\n\u001b[93mFUN_140028e58\u001b[97m (PowerShell), 2 →\u001b