[0.000, "o", "\u001b[97m🤖\u001b[36m\u001b[1m ReverseEngineer(Pasiphae)\u001b(B\u001b[m                                                               \r\n\u001b[93mFUN_140029900\u001b[97m is already renamed\u001b[93m c2_loader_tasking\u001b[97m: POSTs a \"loader\" request to C2 and dispatches tasks: type 0 →\u001b[93m FUN_140028978\u001b[97m (EXE), 1 →\r\n\u001b[93mFUN_140028e58\u001b[97m (PowerShell), 2 →\u001b[93m FUN_140029224\u001b[97m (MSI). It also contains the assert path\u001b[93m C:\\builder_v2\\stealc\\json.h\u001b[97m. Now resolving the DAT_1400b4e08\r\nidentity and confirming Sh\u001b[CllExecuteExA name slot.\u001b[39m                                                                                        \r\n                                                                                                                                                  \r\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[39m \u001b[90mReverseEngineer(Pasiphae) · ▸ read(0x14003c118) · 96 chars\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
