[0.015, "o", "\u001b[4;1H\u001b[93mfile.\u001b[39m                                                                                                                          \r\n\u001b[93m-\u001b[1m CopyFileA\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m (3 readers) /\u001b[1m DeleteFileA\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m (3 readers): all are the\u001b[1m staging-copy pattern\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m — grabber_enum_match_collect_files copies a matched file to the\r\ntemp prefix, reads it, deletes\u001b[3m its own copy\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m; browser_profil\u001b[Cs_enum_and_harvest (FUN_14001d7a0,\u001b[Cdecompiled in full) creates its own\u001b[Cstaging dir\u001b[39m       \r\n\u001b[93m(DAT_1400b4dc8=C\u001b[CeateDirectory-class), c\u001b[Cpies browser profile data\u001b[Cthere via FUN_14003b224 (Copy\u001b[5C-based dir\u001b[Ccopy), parses creds per profile\u001b[39m   \r\n\u001b[93m(FUN_14\u001b[C01b280), then DeleteFileA + RemoveDirectory-class (DAT_1400b4d98) on\u001b[1m its own staged copies only\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m. No origi\u001b[Cal user file is deleted, renamed,\u001b[39m \r\n\u001b[93mor modified.\u001b[10;3H\u001b[1mM\u001b[Cve\u001b[4C*/CryptEncrypt/CryptEncrypt\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
