[0.067, "o", "\u001b[4;1H\u001b[93msession-struct +0x48/+0x60/+0x78 (!123). This matches Stealc v2's server-side target-list design (!59): desktop wallets are grabbed via\r\nserv\u001b[Cr-supplied file-grabber rules.\u001b[39m                                                                                                                \r\n\u001b[93m- Browser-extension theft plumbing is hardcoded:\u001b[Cprefix chrome_extension_ 0x1400b04f0 (blob 0x14007e670) consumed\u001b[Cby\u001b[39m                      \r\n\u001b[93mbrowser_profiles_enum_and_harvest @ 0x14001d7a0 (xr\u001b[Cfs 0x14001dfe3/0x14001dff4, plus FUN_14001ebe4 @ 0x14001ed07); IndexedDB 0x1400b0710 and\r\nfrom_IndexedDB 0x1400b1d10 slots \u001b[Chow extension LevelDB/IndexedDB stores (where wallet extensions keep vaults) are collected.\r\n\u001b[39m                                                                                                                    \r\n\u001b[93m\u001b[1mSteam — hardcoded built-in module:\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m steam_steal_ssfn_vdf_module\u001b[1m @ 0x140037704\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m, gated on config flag\u001b[Csteal_steam (0x1400b2350,\u001b[Cblob \u001b[Cx140\u001b[C7eca0) =\r\nlocal_65 in stealer_main_pay\u001b[2Cad\u001b[C(call site \u001b[Cn th\u001b[C orchestrator tail). Decompiled f\u001b[Cow:\u001b[39m                                      \u001b[13;1H\u001b[94m1. \u001b[93mRegOpenKeyExA(HKEY_CURRENT_USER\u001b[C/*0x80000001 \u001b[Cign-ext*/, DAT_1400b0b10 = \"Sof\u001b[Cware\\Valve\\Steam\", 0, 0x20119\u001b[C/*KEY_READ*/)\u001b[Cvia ptr DAT_140\u001b[Cb4e50\r\n\u001b[94m2. \u001b[93mRegQueryValueExA(h, DAT_1400b1690 =\u001b[C\"S\u001b[2CamPa\u001b[2C\", ...) vi\u001b[C DAT_1400b4e48, RegCloseKey via DAT_1400b4e40\r\n\u001b[94m3.\u001b[93m Appends DAT_1400b03f0 = \\config\\, builds a grab rule with\u001b[1m mask list DAT_1400b1a50 =\r\n\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93mssfn*,config.vdf,DialogConfig.vdf,DialogConfigOverlay*.vdf\u001b[Clibraryfolders.vdf,loginusers