 no code in this binary references Range A — it is carried (linker-retained, unreferenced) MSVC-style SIMD constant data, consistent with\r\nCRT/STL vector-algorithm tables whose consumer routines were dropped. It is NOT obfuscated\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m\u001b[1m attacker data: nothing decodes or reads it.\r\n\u001b(B\u001b[m                                                                                                                                              \r\n\u001b[93mResidual not fully swept (context limit): the idiom lea reg,[nearby_base]; [reg+large_const] where base RVA ∈ 0x6fe00..0x71e00 — the scan for\r\nimag\u001b[C-base-relative disp32\u001b[Cwith RVA 0x6fe00..0x71e00 was prepared (scan_rva_disp with args\u001b[Clo1=0x6fe00 hi1=0x71e00) but\u001b[2Cts two runs did not execute.\r\nRIP-\u001b[Ce\u001b[Cative target\u001b[C in 0x14006fe00..0x140071e00 were already swept: 0 hits besides the 4 string/table bases named above, none of which is indexed\r\ninto Range A by its consumer (FUN_14003dfd8 is a 3-way error-string selector; FUN_14003e62c is a rand_s wrapper).\r\n\u001b[39m                                                                                                                                                    \r\n\u001b[93m💬 reply #fn-14003e62c\u001b[36m\u001b[1m Developer(Themisto)\u001b(B\u001b[m                                                                                            \r\n\u001b[93mThe four T1140 \"recovered string\" findings here (0x140072581/0x1400725a1/0x1400725c1/0x140072601, ADD 0x70/0x72) are false positives. The raw bytes\r\nare the MSVC-sty\u001b[Ce\u001b[Ccons\u001b[Cant table\u001b[C16-2*popcount(\u001b[C) startin\u001b[C at 0x140072580\u001b[C(10 0e 0e 0\u001b[C 0e 0c 0c 0a …);\u001b[CADD-ing 0x7\u001b[C/0x72 maps\u001b[Csmall\u001b[Ceve\u001b[2Cvalues into\r\nprinta\u001b[Cle p…~, produc\u001b[Cng the ~~|~||z… strings — a numerologic\u001b[Cl artif\u001b[Cct, not a decode. A full .text operand scan (RIP-relative, imm64,\u001b[39m              \r\n\u001b[93mimage-b\u001b[Cse-rel\u001b[Ctive RVA\u001b[Cdisp32, and file-wide scan_\u001b[2Cfs pointer slots)\u001b[Cfound\u001b[1m zero\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m code references to 0x140071e00–0x140072800: see\u001b[39m                 \r\n\u001b[93m#range-a-unreferenced. FUN_14003e62c itself\u001b[6Crand_s/std::random_d\u001b[Cvi\u001b[Ce wrapper (decompiled) and never touches these addresses.\u001b[32;96H\u001b[36m\u001b[1m⠼ \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[90mThink\u001b[2Cg…\u001b[39m \u001b[35m\u001b[1mDeveloper(Themisto)\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[37m: calling creat\u001b[C_commen\u001b[34;2H\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
