[0.000, "o", "\u001b[97mow would ship an unverified script.\u001b[1m Flagged for review\u001b[C\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[97m(flag 10, ref\r\n#rdata-ranges-xref-scan) as \u001b[C consolidation \u001b[Candidate for a futur\u001b[C run.\u001b[39m                                                                 \r\n\u001b[97m- \u001b[93mdbg_one/dbg_scan/dbg_decode/dbg_cerrent\u001b[97m, \u001b[93mtest_disasm_anchor\u001b[97m, \u001b[93msite_context\u001b[97m, \u001b[93mgrep_decomp_for_ranges\u001b[97m, \u001b[93mresolve_globals\u001b[97m — one-off debug helpers.\u001b[39m      \r\n                                                                       \r\n\u001b[97mCuration summary posted as comment !148 under the #q-bulk-strings thread.\u001b[39m                                                                    \u001b[30;1H\u001b[90m○\u001b[39m \u001b[90mmain · ▸ finish() · …running\u001b[39m                                           \u001b[32;97H           \u001b[C          \u001b[36m\u001b[1m⠏ \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[90mThinking…\u001b[39m \u001b[35m\u001b[1mmain\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[37m: c\u001b[Clling fin\u001b[Csh\u001b[34;2H\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
