[0.020, "o", "\u001b[4;1H\u001b[93m📌 #memory-curation-record — End-of-run memory curation: 1 family-intel memory updated, 5 generic lessons saved\u001b[36m\u001b[1m Researcher(Iocaste)\r\n\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[93mCross-run memory library updated from this run's verified findings. Every item was checked against forum evidence before saving; no sample hashes,\r\nIPs, build IDs, RC4 keys, or expiry dates were stored.\u001b[39m                                       \u001b[8;1H\u001b[93m\u001b[1mUpdated (overwrite):\u001b(B\u001b[m                                    \u001b[10;1H\u001b[93m- stealc-family-intel-v1-v2 — v2 facts promoted from hypothesis to VERIFIED, sourced from: base64→RC4 pre-main initializer string table (!60),\r\nWinINet transport / empty UA / base64(JSON) bodies / create-upload_file-loader-done flow (!112, !116, !123, !140), WinHttp strings proven vestigial\r\n(!142), pre-mapped sRDI ABE helper + Early-Bird APC (!77–!79), named-EVENT guard with %p-pointer+\"suka\" bug (!111), 4-blob date kill-switch with\u001b(B\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[93m\"%d/%m/%Y\" (!113), CIS LANGID sub-chain (!108), HAL9TH/JohnDoe absent in v2 (!117), no-persistence profile (!107, !121), builder path\u001b[39m   \r\n\u001b[93mC:\\builder_v2\\stealc\\json.h (!144), genuine proccess typo + \"GetCerrentProcessId\"-is-not-a-fingerprint caution (!104).\r\n\u001b[39m \u001b[C                                                         \r\n\u001b[93m\u001b[1mNew generic memories:\r\n\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[C                    \r\n\u001b[94m1.\u001b[93m pitfall-candidate-key-carvings-are-string-table-ciphertext — from #q-crypto-keys (!76/!81): all 18 detector \"keys\" were mid-string ciphertext\r\nfragments.\r\n\u001b[94m2.\u001b[93m pitfall-crt-constant-tables-fake-xor-decodes — from #range-a-unreferenced / #range-b-consumers / !125: pshufb LUTs, UCRT power-of-10 tables, and\r\nXOR-replayed CRT strings produce fake decodes and false T1486 flags; require non-CRT code consumers.\r\n\u001b[94m3.\u001b[93m workflow-proving-behavioral-negatives-multi-rou\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[93mte — from #q-persistence (!107/!121): byte grep (ASCII+UTF-16LE) + full decrypted-string sweep +\r\nAPI capability map + CLSID byte search + calibration statement.\r\n\u001b[94m4.\u001b[93m pitfall-interleaved-getprocaddress-slot-attribution — from !146: nearest-LEA pairing would have mislabeled GetFileAttributesA as ResetEvent; trace\r\nthe slot writer and preceding call instead.\r\n\u001b[94m5.\u001b[93m technique-ciphertext-prefix-search-for-string-absence — from !117/!119: deterministic per-blob RC4 keystream → base64 prefix search proves\r\nplaintext absence whole-image (with mid-blob caveat).\r\n\u001b[39m \u001b[C                                                                                         \r\n\u001b[93mNot saved: anything per-build (C2 endpoint, build ID, RC4 key value, expiry date, blob addresses, file hashes) — those remain forum/IOC-list facts\r\n(#final-iocs).\u001b[39m                                                                             \u001b[32;99H\u001b[36m\u001b[1m⠙\u001b[40C\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[37mcreate_p\u001b[Cst\u001b[34;2H\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
